# MoveSafe VN - Cursor & Agent Rules

## Specialized Skills Available in Project
The project has locally mounted skills in `.agents/skills/`:
- **UI/UX Guidelines**: `.agents/skills/ui-ux-pro-max-skill-2.15.0/SKILL.md`
- **Office Document Processing**: `.agents/skills/OfficeCLI-1.0.153/SKILL.md`
- **Project Memory & Wiki**: `.agents/skills/ai-memory-retrieval/SKILL.md`
- **Reverse Engineering**: `.agents/skills/reverse-engineer-anything/SKILL.md`

## UI Rules
- Strictly NO icons or emojis in the UI, map pins, toasts, or AI responses.
- Use clean, minimal typography and high-contrast badges.
- Primary colors: Slate Dark (`#0f172a`), Royal Blue (`#2563eb`), Subtle Gray (`#f8fafc`).
